# Binary assets are stored directly in Git, not in Git LFS.
#
# The deployment target (Vercel) checks out the repository without smudging
# LFS pointers, so images and fonts tracked with `filter=lfs` were deployed as
# ~130-byte pointer files and rendered as broken images. Everything in
# `public/` is small (the whole folder is under 200 KB), so plain Git blobs are
# the right trade-off here.
#
# Do not re-add `filter=lfs` rules for this project unless the deployment
# pipeline is changed to fetch LFS objects.
